OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F436A1786614495
OL,3,CDisabled passengers left frustrated by
OL,4,Ccapital city's taxi services
OL,6,FDisabled people have told ITV Wales
OL,7,Fthat they are being let down by
OL,8,FCardiff's taxi companies and drivers
OL,9,Fwho either cannot or refuse to
OL,10,Ftransport them.
OL,12,FBritain's Got Talent winner Lee Ridley
OL,13,Fand disability campaigner Kat Watkins
OL,14,Fhave both shared their frustration
OL,15,Fover drivers refusing fares to
OL,16,Fwheelchair users and falling
OL,17,Faccessible taxi numbers after their
OL,18,Fseparate experiences in the capital.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/11
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
