PN,43602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F436A1786614495
OL,3,CDisabled passengers left frustrated by
OL,4,Ccapital city's taxi services
OL,6,FIn Cardiff, the number of wheelchair-
OL,7,Faccessible cabs has more than halved
OL,8,Fin the last 16 years.
OL,10,FNow there are calls for legal
OL,11,Frequirements for new accessible fleets
OL,12,Fand car manufacturers to build greener
OL,13,Foptions.
OL,15,FAs an electric wheelchair user, Kat
OL,16,Fsaid she was turned away by a Cardiff
OL,17,Ftaxi driver after he claimed her
OL,18,Fwheelchair would break his ramp.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/11
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,437,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F436A1786614495
OL,3,CDisabled passengers left frustrated by
OL,4,Ccapital city's taxi services
OL,6,FHis refusal to transport her forced
OL,7,FKat to make a two-mile journey in the
OL,8,Frain, which she described as
OL,9,F"upsetting".
OL,11,FShe said: "As an electric wheelchair,
OL,12,FI try to be professional, but it's
OL,13,Fjust made me feel like I can't be a
OL,14,Fprofessional because I'm always going
OL,15,Fto turn up dishevelled.
OL,17,F"I'm never going to get from A to B
OL,18,F100%.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/11
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,437,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F436A1786614495
OL,3,CDisabled passengers left frustrated by
OL,4,Ccapital city's taxi services
OL,6,F"I'm thankful that I have a wheelchair
OL,7,Fthat is able to do it, and has the
OL,8,Fspeed to do it to get there on time,
OL,9,Fbut there are so many people that
OL,10,Fcan't, and this is not a new problem
OL,11,Fat all.
OL,13,F"It just left me feeling so terrible
OL,14,Fthis time that I actually couldn't
OL,15,Ftalk about it for a few days because
OL,16,Fit upset me so much."
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G4/11
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
