PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F436A1786614495
OL,3,CDisabled passengers left frustrated by
OL,4,Ccapital city's taxi services
OL,6,FComedian Lee Ridley, known to many as
OL,7,FLost Voice Guy and winner of Britain's
OL,8,FGot Talent, has cerebral palsy which
OL,9,Faffects his speech and movement,
OL,10,Fmeaning he occasionally uses a
OL,11,Fwheelchair.
OL,13,FAfter performing a show in Cardiff,
OL,14,Fthe comedian told ITV Wales how he
OL,15,Fexperienced difficulty booking an
OL,16,Faccessible taxi, which he describes as
OL,17,F"disappointing" for a capital city.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G5/11
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,437,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F436A1786614495
OL,3,CDisabled passengers left frustrated by
OL,4,Ccapital city's taxi services
OL,6,FHe said: "I needed to get to the
OL,7,Fstation to catch my train, and I
OL,8,Factually started trying to book an
OL,9,Faccessible taxi more than 24 hours in
OL,10,Fadvance. Despite ringing five
OL,11,Fdifferent taxi companies, not one of
OL,12,Fthem could help.
OL,14,F"The frustrating thing was that I
OL,15,Fcould see plenty of wheelchair
OL,16,Faccessible taxis at ranks around the
OL,17,Fcity. The problem is you can't book
OL,18,Fthose.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G6/11
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,437,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F436A1786614495
OL,3,CDisabled passengers left frustrated by
OL,4,Ccapital city's taxi services
OL,6,F"Thankfully I managed to find one, but
OL,7,Fgetting home shouldn't depend on pot
OL,8,Fluck."
OL,10,FThe 45-year-old also explained how
OL,11,Fthis was not the first time he had
OL,12,Ffaced challenges booking transport:
OL,13,F"I've had drivers who seem reluctant
OL,14,Fto take me because they don't want the
OL,15,Fhassle of getting the ramp or securing
OL,16,Fmy wheelchair.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G7/11
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,437,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F436A1786614495
OL,3,CDisabled passengers left frustrated by
OL,4,Ccapital city's taxi services
OL,6,F"It's something many wheelchair users
OL,7,Fexperience, it was disappointing
OL,8,Fbecause you would expect a capital
OL,9,Fcity to have better provisions. It
OL,10,Fonly takes on bad experience to leave
OL,11,Fyou stranded".
OL,13,F"I think it should be a legal
OL,14,Frequirement that all new taxis are
OL,15,Fwheelchair accessible, if we are
OL,16,Fserious about equality, we need to
OL,17,Fstop putting inaccessible vehicles on
OL,18,Fthe road."
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G8/11
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
