FL,437,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43609
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F436A1786614495
OL,3,CDisabled passengers left frustrated by
OL,4,Ccapital city's taxi services
OL,6,FIn a statement, Cardiff Council said:
OL,7,F"Refusing to carry a disabled
OL,8,Fpassenger, failing to provide
OL,9,Freasonable assistance, or charging a
OL,10,Fdisabled passenger more are criminal
OL,11,Foffences, not matters of the driver's
OL,12,Fdiscretion.
OL,14,F"Cardiff Council investigates every
OL,15,Freport it receives and takes action
OL,16,Fwhere the evidence supports it.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G9/11
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,437,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43610
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F436A1786614495
OL,3,CDisabled passengers left frustrated by
OL,4,Ccapital city's taxi services
OL,6,F"In 2010, Cardiff licensed 475
OL,7,Fwheelchair accessible hackney
OL,8,Fcarriages - today that figure is 168.
OL,9,FOver the same period, the number of
OL,10,Fprivate hire vehicles licensed by
OL,11,FCardiff has grown from 865 to more
OL,12,Fthan 1,600, and private hire is the
OL,13,Fsector where councils have very
OL,14,Flimited powers to require wheelchair
OL,15,Faccessibility.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                  G10/11
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,437,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43611
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F436A1786614495
OL,3,CDisabled passengers left frustrated by
OL,4,Ccapital city's taxi services
OL,6,F"Private hire vehicles licensed
OL,7,Fanywhere in England or Wales can also
OL,8,Flawfully work in Cardiff, highlighting
OL,9,Fthe need for this issue to be
OL,10,Faddressed at a national level, as
OL,11,Findividual authorities are limited in
OL,12,Fwhat they can achieve on their own.
OL,14,F"These are concerns we have raised
OL,15,Fwith Welsh Government through
OL,16,Fconsultations on taxi and private hire
OL,17,Flicensing reform."
OL,19,FThe Welsh Government says it is
OL,20,Fresearching transport barriers and has
OL,21,Fissued guidance to councils.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                  G11/11
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
